{
  "abstract": "Lean 4 formalisation of the main results of Jacob Fox and László Miklós Lovász, A tight bound for Green's arithmetic triangle removal lemma in vector spaces (arXiv:1606.01230): the arithmetic triangle removal lemma in F_p^n with a polynomial bound (Theorem 1), the Kleinberg–Sawin–Speyer bound on multicolored sum-free families (Theorem 2), the count of triangles spanned by vertex-disjoint triangles (Theorem 3), and the tightness of the exponent in Theorem 1 (the second part of Theorem 1).",
